#: ../../../rest/db-completion-get.rst:2
msgid "GET /rest/db/completion"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/db-completion-get.rst:4
msgid ""
"Returns the completion percentage (0 to 100) and byte / item counts. Takes "
"optional ``device`` and ``folder`` parameters:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/db-completion-get.rst:7
msgid ""
"``folder`` specifies the folder ID to calculate completion for. An empty or "
"absent ``folder`` parameter means all folders as an aggregate."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/db-completion-get.rst:10
msgid ""
"``device`` specifies the device ID to calculate completion for. An empty or "
"absent ``device`` parameter means the local device."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/db-completion-get.rst:13
msgid ""
"If a device is specified but no folder, completion is calculated for all "
"folders shared with that device."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/db-completion-get.rst:17
msgid "Example Queries"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/db-completion-get.rst:19
msgid ""
"Completion status for folder ``abcd-1234`` on device "
"``I6KAH76-...-3PSROAU``::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/db-completion-get.rst:21
msgid "/rest/db/completion?folder=abcd-1234&device=I6KAH76-...-3PSROAU"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/db-completion-get.rst:23
msgid ""
"Aggregated completion status for device ``I6KAH76-...-3PSROAU`` (all folders "
"shared with them)::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/db-completion-get.rst:25
msgid "/rest/db/completion?device=I6KAH76-...-3PSROAU"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/db-completion-get.rst:27
msgid "Completion status for folder ``abcd-1234`` on the local device::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/db-completion-get.rst:29
msgid "/rest/db/completion?folder=abcd-1234"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/db-completion-get.rst:31
msgid "Aggregated completion status for all folders on the local device::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/db-completion-get.rst:33
msgid "/rest/db/completion"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/db-completion-get.rst:36
msgid "Example Response"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/db-completion-get.rst:38
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"completion\": 99.9937565835,\n"
"  \"globalBytes\": 156793013575,\n"
"  \"needBytes\": 9789241,\n"
"  \"globalItems\": 7823,\n"
"  \"needItems\": 412,\n"
"  \"needDeletes\": 0,\n"
"  \"remoteState\": \"valid\",\n"
"  \"sequence\": 12\n"
"}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/db-completion-get.rst:53
msgid ""
"The ability to aggregate multiple folders by leaving out the folder ID. "
"Querying data for the local device by leaving out the device ID. Returning "
"the ``globalItems`` counter in the response."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/db-completion-get.rst:59
msgid ""
"Indication whether the remote device has accepted the folder (shares it with "
"us) as well, and whether it is paused.  The ``remoteState`` field is "
"meaningless for aggregated responses, ``unknown`` when the remote device is "
"not connected.  Otherwise it can be either ``paused``, ``notSharing``, or "
"``valid`` if the remote is sharing back."
msgstr ""
